"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/neoflex-led-letters\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A (LED strip)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1,800 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}14:Tb97,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes NeoFlex LED Letters different from traditional neon signs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"NeoFlex LED Letters combine the classic neon aesthetic with modern LED efficiency, providing brighter illumination at 1,800 nits with enhanced durability and energy savings. Unlike fragile glass neon tubes, they use flexible, shatter-proof silicone-encased LED strips.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for NeoFlex LED Letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"NeoFlex Letters are lightweight and flexible, allowing easy mounting on various surfaces including walls and signage boards. Their bend radius of 30mm minimum enables custom shapes, while the IP67 rating ensures durability in outdoor conditions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Are there warranty options available for NeoFlex LED Letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, NeoFlex LED Letters come with a standard warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance for a specified period. Please contact Brightluxx for detailed warranty terms tailored to your project requirements.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does NeoFlex compare to traditional LED channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"NeoFlex LED Letters offer a unique neon look with flexible, silicone-encased strips as opposed to rigid LED channel letters. This flexibility allows for more creative designs and smoother curves, making NeoFlex ideal for vintage or retro aesthetics.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can NeoFlex LED Letters be used outdoors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, these letters are fully weather-resistant with an IP67 rating, making them suitable for both indoor and outdoor applications. Their silicone casing protects against dust and water, ensuring long-lasting performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What color options are available for NeoFlex LED Letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"NeoFlex offers over 120 color options, including vibrant neons and vintage warm whites, allowing customization to match any brand or design theme.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the expected lifespan of NeoFlex LED Letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a lifespan exceeding 50,000 hours, NeoFlex LED Letters provide long-term reliability and reduced maintenance compared to traditional neon or some other LED solutions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do pricing and energy consumption compare to conventional neon signs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"While the initial investment may be comparable or slightly higher, NeoFlex LED Letters consume significantly less energy and require minimal maintenance, leading to lower lifetime costs compared to traditional neon.\"}}]}9:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"da